{"id":"1412958675526774788","date":"2021-07-08","url":"https://x.com/markchen90/status/1412958675526774788","author":"markchen90","text":"As someone who dabbles in competitive programming, Codex won't produce results you can brag to your friends about. Nevertheless, it's greatly exceeded my expectations for what language models trained on code are capable of!","reply_to":"markchen90","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20210708021621","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210708021621/https://twitter.com/markchen90/status/1412958675526774788","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
